MODULE: ClassPriorityDriveCountsColdOwners
TARGET: ClassPriority
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: cold owners wrongly consume independent GC drive reservations
PERTURBS: DriveAdmission

--- FIND
    /\ LET accepted == free > 0 /\ Cardinality(DriveHolders) < Max(1, Circulating \div 2)
--- REPLACE
    /\ LET accepted == free > 0 /\ Cardinality(holders) < Max(1, Circulating \div 2)
--- END
